WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:08.640
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a thriller drama film called “Monolith.”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:18.480
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
The movie begins with an advertisement for a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:24.320
futuristic car brand named Monolith. The presenter&nbsp;
from the advertisement states that the car is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:30.080
awarded as the safest car in the world and has&nbsp;
a number of unique safety features. He claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:36.000
that the car is extremely modern and has several&nbsp;
features like unbreakable glass, strong tires,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.840
rigid body, and many more to keep its riders&nbsp;
safe from every possible theft and damage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:47.360
An AI-connected smartphone app is used to control&nbsp;
all the features while being inside the car.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:52.880
A virtual assistant called Lilith helps to&nbsp;
interact with the user interface of the car. 
&nbsp;

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:57.600
In the next scene, we can see a mother&nbsp;
carrying her kid inside the same AI car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.680
to his granny’s home. While talking&nbsp;
to the AI assistant, Lilith,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:07.360
we get to know that the mother’s name is Sandra&nbsp;
and her 2-year-old son is David. Her husband,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:11.440
Carl, is a pilot who could not join&nbsp;
them due to his busy schedule. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:16.320
car is so advanced that it can even detect the&nbsp;
weight of the passengers inside the vehicle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:22.160
Later, Carl calls them and informs that he is&nbsp;
at the central airport after his duty and misses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:28.480
them a lot. Just then, someone knocks on the door&nbsp;
and Carl says his goodbye and leaves. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:33.120
David starts becoming fussy so Sandra hands&nbsp;
him her smartphone to keep him occupied.
&nbsp;

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:41.440
After some time, Sandra takes a halt at a gas&nbsp;
station on the side of the road. She then takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:46.560
David inside the washroom and changes his diapers&nbsp;
while some girls are seen giggling. The gas&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:52.000
station also has a supermarket where Sandra buys&nbsp;
her son his favorite snacks. While paying at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.360
counter, Sandra notices someone trying to break&nbsp;
into her car outside. Instead of being worried,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:02.400
she just takes out her smartphone and locks&nbsp;
the vehicle using the smart app. As Sandra is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:07.360
busy inspecting the situation, she doesn’t even&nbsp;
notice that David has been separated from her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:12.880
After she realizes that David is lost, she screams&nbsp;
and searches for him around the supermarket.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:18.160
She rushes outside and even calls a stranger&nbsp;
assuming that David is with him. She seems to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:23.520
be totally freaked out until she finds David with&nbsp;
the same three ladies whom she met earlier at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:29.040
washroom. Sandra immediately puts David into&nbsp;
her car and activates the vault mode feature.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:34.560
This disengages her from what's happening outside&nbsp;
and she finally breathes a sigh of relief.
&nbsp;

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:39.120
After leaving the gas station, Sandra still&nbsp;
has a long distance to drive until they reach&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:44.400
her mother-in-law’s house. Due to the long&nbsp;
ride, Sandra feels bored and decides to call&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:50.000
her childhood friend, Jessa to check on her. Jessa&nbsp;
receives the call and informs her that she is near&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:55.200
the central airport at a hotel. She even tells&nbsp;
Jessa that she has been staying at the hotel with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:00.960
Carl. Sandra is devastated at the revelation of&nbsp;
her friend having an affair with her husband.
&nbsp;

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:05.600
She becomes so frustrated that she does not even&nbsp;
bother to enter her mother-in-law’s house after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:09.680
reaching the entrance. She continues&nbsp;
calling Carl but he doesn’t pick up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:14.400
and pretends to be busy. Fed up with the&nbsp;
lies, Sandra decides to take matters into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:20.240
her own hands and hence sets her journey to find&nbsp;
Carl at the central airport in Los Angeles. 
&nbsp;

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:27.120
On her way, a board shows that the distance to Los&nbsp;
Angeles is about 320 miles. After a while, Lilith,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:32.320
the smart AI, mentions that a serious accident&nbsp;
has taken place on the main highway, which will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:37.920
slow them down. She then suggests Sandra take the&nbsp;
bypass road, which will save them a lot of time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:43.520
However, the AI also mentions that the route&nbsp;
is deserted and barely has any passengers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:47.760
Sandra, who is adamant on confronting&nbsp;
her husband, does not think twice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:52.000
and takes the alternative route.
Later, it gets dark and Sandra starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:57.760
to feel difficulty in driving the car. The fog on&nbsp;
the way also intensifies, which affects her vision&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:03.920
of the road in front. On her way, she finds no&nbsp;
human settlements or any other vehicles. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:09.440
she finds an electrical substation located in the&nbsp;
middle of nowhere. She glances over the place but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:14.960
soon drives away. The place is so deserted that&nbsp;
the only beings present there are wild animals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:20.480
Suddenly, a nervous Sandra loses her focus and&nbsp;
crashes into a deer which was trying to cross&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:24.800
the road. Because of the collision,&nbsp;
David starts crying and like always,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:32.640
Sandra gives her smartphone to calm him down. She&nbsp;
then immediately gets out to check on the animal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:38.160
but it appears to be almost dead.The deer is stuck&nbsp;
below the front part of the car and because of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:42.960
Sandra is unable to move her car ahead. As&nbsp;
Sandra is trying to figure out the situation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:47.600
she forgets that she has left David alone in&nbsp;
the car. Meanwhile, as David is playing with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:52.480
the cellphone, he accidentally opens the&nbsp;
AI car app. He moves his finger around the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:56.880
opened app and without Sandra’s notice,&nbsp;
activates the Vault feature of the car.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:01.680
This feature protects the passengers inside&nbsp;
from all kinds of disturbances and danger.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:05.600
Sandra realizes the gravity of the&nbsp;
situation and tries her best to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:10.160
open the door but it's already too late.
As Sandra is locked outside the car,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:14.720
she tries her best to make the 2 year old&nbsp;
David switch off the vault mode but he doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:20.080
understand a word and simply keeps on playing&nbsp;
with the phone. Later, Sandra panics and starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:25.280
shouting at the little kid, which startles him,&nbsp;
and he drops the smartphone under his seat. 
&nbsp;

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:30.320
Here, Sandra gets to know that the Monolith car’s&nbsp;
features are not just an advertisement but it also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:35.200
performs in reality. Even when Sandra tries to&nbsp;
break the glass with a rock, not a single scratch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:42.880
can be seen on the window glass. Seeing all her&nbsp;
efforts go in vain, Sandra decides to seek other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:47.600
options. She begins walking back to the electrical&nbsp;
substation which she noticed before. 
&nbsp;

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:52.880
After some walking, she reaches the station, jumps&nbsp;
over the fence and cries out for help. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:58.400
she gets no response and the station seems to&nbsp;
be empty with no workers present at the moment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:03.760
After this, Sandra enters one of the rooms and&nbsp;
finds some necessary items inside. She takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:08.560
a flashlight to use at night and a big wrench&nbsp;
to help her break the glass of the locked car.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:12.880
Just as she leaves the substation, she&nbsp;
notices a wild animal following her.
&nbsp;

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:18.480
As Sandra rushes back, a coyote attacks her so&nbsp;
she climbs onto the roof of the car. Despite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:23.440
her best efforts to scare off the animal, it&nbsp;
remains unphased. In a last ditch attempt,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:28.000
Sandra starts banging the car with the wrench&nbsp;
and an alarm starts blaring, which finally makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:33.440
the coyote retreat. Just then, Sandra notices&nbsp;
David having difficulties in breathing. Despite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:39.200
the situation, she manages to calm David and he&nbsp;
finally starts breathing and soon falls asleep.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:44.880
After a bit of thinking, Sandra too becomes tired&nbsp;
and falls asleep on the bonnet of the car. 
&nbsp;

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:48.400
The next day, Sandra wakes up&nbsp;
when the sun is already bright.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:53.440
She then immediately rushes to check David’s&nbsp;
condition inside the car. She finds David weak&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:58.720
and feeble because of his hungry stomach and&nbsp;
dehydration. One of the features of the car also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:03.600
displays the temperature of the surroundings&nbsp;
which appears to be increasing slowly. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:09.120
condition is a curse to Sandra as the place is&nbsp;
completely isolated with no humans around.
&nbsp;

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:14.240
Sandra then decides to seek help and follows&nbsp;
the road. Despite being severely dehydrated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:18.720
she proceeds to walk the long journey. She&nbsp;
also knows the risks of leaving David alone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:23.120
in the overheated car but she has no&nbsp;
choice but to seek help. Fortunately,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:28.080
she comes across a river where she drinks and&nbsp;
cleans herself. After gaining some respite,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:33.920
she continues her journey and encounters steep&nbsp;
hills along the path. After walking several miles,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:39.680
Sandra finally comes across an old airfield, where&nbsp;
she discovers a jet. Meanwhile, the temperature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:44.960
inside the Monolith car rises up, causing it to&nbsp;
instantly start the emergency cooling fan.  
&nbsp;

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:49.680
After reaching the abandoned jet, Sandra enters&nbsp;
inside and discovers some alcoholic drinks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:54.240
a gallon of gasoline, a lighter&nbsp;
and a pair of spare airplane tires.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:59.760
She consumes some alcohol and immediately gathers&nbsp;
the necessary items. After that, Sandra uses the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:05.040
gasoline to burn the two tires, in hopes of&nbsp;
attracting help. She then takes the gallon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:10.400
and fills it with the river water. Slowly, Sandra&nbsp;
walks back to the place where she left David. 
&nbsp;

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:16.400
In the next scene, Sandra hurries to the car and&nbsp;
finds David all weak and turning red. She tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:21.840
calling him out, but David does not answer or&nbsp;
move. The temperature inside the car has increased&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:27.920
significantly and the emergency cooling fans have&nbsp;
become ineffective. Seeing the state of her son,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:31.760
Sandra immediately climbs the roof and&nbsp;
pours the water she brought from the river,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:36.560
but all her efforts go into vain. Thinking that&nbsp;
her child will have to die inside the high-tech&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:42.480
vehicle, she again starts to hit the car window&nbsp;
with the wrench but it just wastes her energy. 
&nbsp;

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:46.960
Later, Sandra tries to light a fire outside&nbsp;
the car in hopes that the censors will detect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:53.440
the smoke and open the windows, but none of this&nbsp;
happens. Instead, the emergency cooling fans stop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:58.560
running to prevent the smoke from entering&nbsp;
inside. Fatigued, Sandra falls to the ground&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:04.480
and gets a vision of her and Carl visiting the&nbsp;
same accident place after a year. There, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:10.320
realizes her mistakes and still blames Carl for&nbsp;
David’s death. After some time, she wakes up to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:15.280
some noise and finds it all to be her dream. 
To make the situation worse, the coyote from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:20.480
last night again appears in front of her. Sandra&nbsp;
decides to hide from it and tries to climb on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:25.360
roof of the car. But as the car’s temperature&nbsp;
is extremely high, she can’t stay there and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:31.600
instead slides below the car. There, the coyote&nbsp;
bites her leg and this is when Sandra realizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:36.640
that it is the deer that the coyote is after.&nbsp;
As soon as the coyote drags the deer out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:39.920
the car starts rolling backwards. The&nbsp;
deer was the reason which had held the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:44.720
car in the position. Sandra immediately gets&nbsp;
out from under the car and tries to stop it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:49.360
from sliding backwards. Despite her best efforts,&nbsp;
the car still continues to roll backwards, edging&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:55.680
closer to a fall. However, a small chunk of&nbsp;
rock obstructs the car and it finally stops.
&nbsp;

00:09:55.680 --> 00:10:00.720
As Sandra stares from the cliff, she remembers&nbsp;
the cartoon she saw earlier at the gas station,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:05.280
where the diamond was obtained after the safe&nbsp;
was broken. She then thinks of pushing the car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:09.520
down to unlock the doors. Sandra is well&nbsp;
aware of the fact that her plans might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:14.480
have consequences but she is left with no&nbsp;
other choice and decides to go with it. 
&nbsp;

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:18.000
She grabs the wrench and starts breaking&nbsp;
the rock which was obstructing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:23.520
tire. After successfully removing the rock,&nbsp;
Sandra purposely pushes the car down the cliff&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:27.200
with David still inside the car. 
As the car is thrown in the air,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:32.480
its inbuilt AI starts to function and immediately&nbsp;
realizes that the car is falling from a height.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:37.280
The features of the car get to work and shift&nbsp;
its balance, studying the gravitational pressure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:42.560
to fall upright, without causing any harm to&nbsp;
David. Since the car was designed to deactivate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:48.240
the vault mode at the time of an accident to let&nbsp;
the rescuers come in, the doors finally open.
&nbsp;

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:52.240
As soon as the car strikes the ground,&nbsp;
Sandra climbs down the cliff and approaches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:57.440
the car. Despite the devastating fall, the car&nbsp;
appears as if someone just placed it there.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:01.280
Finding the locked door open, Sandra&nbsp;
hurriedly takes David out of the car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:06.000
and opens his clothes to help him cool down. 
Seeing David's weak health condition,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:11.120
Sandra resolves to get out of the place as soon as&nbsp;
possible. Before Sandra gets in the car to drive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:17.120
the whole system gets restarted. With the help of&nbsp;
Lilith, Sandra sets the car into extreme offroad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:21.760
mode and starts climbing the cliff in front&nbsp;
of her. The car appears to be made for very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:27.840
extreme conditions and easily gets past the steep&nbsp;
cliff. Miraculously, Sandra reaches the offroad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:32.880
she chose and heads towards the hospital. 
In the last scene of the movie, we see Sandra&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:37.680
and David arriving at the hospital. David is&nbsp;
kept on the hospital bed beside Sandra and is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:43.440
connected with multiple tubes. Sandra seems&nbsp;
worried about David until he opens his eyes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:48.080
and calls her “Mommy” for the first&nbsp;
time. The movie ends as Sandra gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:56.720
delighted at her son calling her out. 
